    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Epoques de Koré\"\nsubtitle: \"Visual Timeline\"\nformat:\n  revealjs:\n    theme: solarized\n    css: styles.css\n---\n\n\n\n# Présence des descendants de Koré\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-74c778273887eea25d74\" style=\"width:960px;height:480px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-74c778273887eea25d74\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"timeline\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"Présence des descendants de Koré\"},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":null}},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"text\":\"figures fidèles du peuple de Dieu à travers les siècles !\"},\"series\":[{\"group\":\"group\",\"data\":[{\"name\":\"<span style='background-color: lightgreen;'>Séjour en Égypte & Exode<\\/span>\",\"label\":\"1600–1200 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"MOÏSE, Koré et Israêl sortent d'Égypte\",\"x\":-1400},{\"name\":\"<span style='background-color: lightgreen;'>Monarchie unifiée<\\/span>\",\"label\":\"1020–930 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"DAVID instaure les 24 classes du service lévitique\",\"x\":-975},{\"name\":\"<span style='background-color: lightgreen;'>Monarchie divisée<\\/span>\",\"label\":\"930–586 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"JOSAPHAT & EZECHIAS  Israël & Juda; Élie; Isaïe; Jérémie\",\"x\":-758},{\"name\":\"Exil à Babylone\",\"label\":\"586–538 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"Destruction du Temple; Ézéchiel; Daniel\",\"x\":-562},{\"name\":\"<span style='background-color: lightgreen;'>Retour d'exil & période perse<\\/span>\",\"label\":\"538–332 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"CYRUS; reconstruction du Temple; Esdras; NEHEMIE\",\"x\":-435},{\"name\":\"Période hellénistique\",\"label\":\"332–164 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"Alexandre; Séleucides; tensions religieuses\",\"x\":-248},{\"name\":\"Période hasmonéenne\",\"label\":\"164–63 av. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"MACCABEES; indépendance; Hasmonéens\",\"x\":-113.5},{\"name\":\"Période romaine\",\"label\":\"63 av. J.-C.–70 ap. J.-C.\",\"description\":\"Pompée; Hérode; naissance et ministère de Jésus\",\"x\":3.5}],\"type\":\"timeline\",\"dataLabels\":{\"useHTML\":true,\"allowOverlap\":false,\"format\":\"<b>{point.name}<\\/b><br>{point.label}\"}}],\"tooltip\":{\"useHTML\":true,\"headerFormat\":\"\",\"pointFormat\":\"<b>({point.x})<\\/b><br>{point.description}\"},\"xAxis\":{\"type\":\"linear\"}},\"theme\":{\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\"},\"colors\":[\"#7cb5ec\",\"#434348\",\"#90ed7d\",\"#f7a35c\",\"#8085e9\",\"#f15c80\",\"#e4d354\",\"#2b908f\",\"#f45b5b\",\"#91e8e1\"]},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: notes\ndu temps de Moise, de Samuel/David, de Josaphat, d Ezechias, de retour d exil a Babylone\n\n1. Moïse (L'Exode) :  autour de 1250 av. J.-C. au temps du règne du pharaon Ramsès II.\n​2. Le roi David : ~1010 à 970 av. J.-C.\n​3. Le roi Josaphat : ~873 à 849 av. J.-C.\n​4. Le roi Ézéchias : ~716 à 687 av. J.-C. célèbre pour ses réformes religieuses et pour avoir résiste au siège du roi assyrien Sennachérib en 701 av. J.-C.\n​5. Le retour d'exil : ~538 av. J.-C. par l edit du roi Cyrus\n:::\n",
